# AEP shipped roots
# Top-level folders that ship in the public tree. Files that sit directly at the
# tree root always ship. Checks that describe the shipped product read only these
# folders, so a local folder at the top level is out of their scope.
# The three runtime roots come first, then the support trees.
# Readers: AEP-User-Experience/harness/check-release-strings.mjs and aep-check.mjs
AEP-Base-Node
AEP-CAW
AEP-Components
AEP-Policy-System
AEP-User-Experience
AEP-Research-Paper
docker
rust
.github
.cargo
